{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"@frozen","kind":"attribute"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"UndirectedIncidenceList","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Vertex","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":"> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"where","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Vertex","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" : ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Hashable","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SH"}],"platforms":["Linux"],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"anchor":"overview","type":"heading","text":"Overview"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The vertices are any ","type":"text"},{"code":"Hashable","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" values, kept in an ","type":"text"},{"code":"OrderedSet","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" whose element ","type":"text"},{"code":"i","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is vertex","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"index ","type":"text"},{"code":"i","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":": the vertices listed first, then new members by first appearance. A hyperedge is a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"set of vertices of any size, the empty set included; repeated hyperedges are kept, each at its","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"own position ","type":"text"},{"code":"0..<hyperedgeCount","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", and a member listed twice is stored once. Members are stored","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"in vertex-index order.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Storage is compressed sparse rows: the members of every hyperedge in one array, and for every"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"vertex its incidence numbers and, beside them, its hyperedge positions, in rows of shared"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"pools. "},{"type":"c